  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting CCIs in Montenegro at policy and implementation level</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leveraging diverse research methodologies, this project aims to update and quantify the economic impact of Cultural and Creative Industries (CCIs) on local and regional development since 2019. It seeks to assess the current landscape and satisfaction within the CCI sector, employing desk research, as well as quantitative and qualitative methods involving creative entrepreneurs. The findings will highlight key lessons, offer strategic recommendations for the sector&amp;#39;s growth, and guide future financing and support mechanisms for CCI entrepreneurs. This analysis will assist the Ministry of Culture and Media of Montenegro in strategic planning for the enhancement of cultural and creative industries.</narrative>
  </description>
